# Gray KAS project wrapper

Use this wrapper only as a profile-local project discovery and composition
entrypoint. It points to the official KAS plugin base and the paired project
overlay; it is not a copy of the base KAS skill pack.

When KAS phase guidance is needed, load the plugin base by qualified name:

```text
skill_view("kkachi-agent-skills:<base>")
```

Role manifest: `kkachi-agent-skills:roles/gray.yaml`

Allowed base subset: `kkachi-review` and `kkachi-final-verify`, as declared by the Gray role manifest. Do not infer additional authority from the
profile or project name.

Overlay lookup:

```text
skills/{{ project }}/{{ project }}-overlay/SKILL.md
skills/{{ project }}/{{ project }}-overlay/references/*.md
```

Optional advanced overlays may live under `skills/{{ project }}/kas-overlays/`
only when the single project overlay is insufficient and the reason is reviewed.

For overlay authoring or composition details, load:

```text
skill_view("kkachi-agent-skills:kas-project-overlay-guide")
skill_view("kkachi-agent-skills:kas-overlay-compose-guide")
skill_view("kkachi-agent-skills:kas-overlay-doctor-guide")
```

If the plugin base, role manifest, or project overlay is missing: stop, report
the exact missing surface, do not use profile-local copied skills as fallback,
and request review or approval.

This wrapper does not authorize profile cleanup, wrapper rollout, KAH/KAB
mutation, runtime/provider/model changes, copied-suite migration, or base-body
replacement.
